        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is the Little Movie Club?",
            "answer": "<p>It's our membership - $160 a year, and it's how the rental library works. Members get:</p><ul><li>Access to the full rental library, 3 movies out at a time</li><li>10% off anything you buy in the store</li><li>Invitations to our Member Events</li><li>A free movie on your birthday</li><li>A physical membership card</li></ul>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Wait, no rental fees?",
            "answer": "<p>Correct. The membership is the fee. Take out three movies, bring them back, take out three more. There's no cap on how many times you do that in a year.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long do I get to keep a movie?",
            "answer": "<p>Fourteen days. Bring it back in the condition you got it in, swap it for something else.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What happens if I'm late?",
            "answer": "<p>Nothing dramatic. There's no daily late fee and no one is going to call your house, but if we see you out in the neighborhood we’ll mention it. We can't check out more movies to you while something is overdue, and if a movie is 30 days past its due date we treat it as lost and charge you the current market rate to replace it. At that point it's yours. Congratulations on your new movie, we suppose.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What if something gets damaged or goes missing?",
            "answer": "<p>If a rental is lost, stolen, or damaged beyond normal wear while it's with you, we'll charge the market-rate replacement cost. That applies the whole time you have it, not just after it's overdue. Normal wear is fine - these are movies, they get watched.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q7": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What is a ‘free movie on your birthday’?",
            "answer": "<p>It’s a movie you pick out from the store on your birthday as a gift. It is a birthday gift to you, Little Movie Club Member. Happy Birthday, please enjoy this movie that is $17 and under.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q8": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "I bought a membership before you opened. When does my year start?",
            "answer": "<p>On opening day, not on the day you bought it. Pre-sale members get the full twelve months from our elusive opening date.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q9": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Does my membership renew automatically?",
            "answer": "<p>Yes, once a year at whatever the annual fee is at that time. We'll give you a heads up before it charges. You can cancel any time and that stops future renewals, though we can't refund the year you're already in - and anything you've got checked out still needs to come back.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q10": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Can my roommate use my card?",
            "answer": "<p>Membership is for you, personally. Rentals are for personal, non-commercial use, and please don't pass them along to someone else. If a movie doesn't come back, it's on your account. Your household watching a movie together is obviously fine. That's like, the entire idea.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q11": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Do I have to be a member to shop?",
            "answer": "<p>Not at all. Roughly half the store is movies for sale, and that's open to everyone. The membership is specifically for the rental side.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q12": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "I donated movies to the rental library. Do I get anything?",
            "answer": "<p>You do. Pre-Launch Donors receive three free months of membership. If you already bought a full year, we'll add the three months on top. Bring yourself to the counter and we'll sort it out.</p>"
          }
        },
